#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Writes this case's fixture data into the run's workspace (both arms see the same files).
# Generated by benchmarks/builder; edit the case script there, not this file.
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p resources
cat > resources/geo_test_design.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Pinecrest Pantry: Meta geo holdout (test design, marketing team)

- Test regions: North West, Yorkshire, East Midlands, Wales. Control regions: North East, West Midlands, South West, Scotland.
- Pre-period: 10 Aug - 6 Sep 2026 (Meta live everywhere). Test period: 7 Sep - 4 Oct 2026 (Meta paused in control regions, unchanged in test regions).
- Gross margin per order: 35%.
- Meta Ads Manager reports 1,190 purchases in the test regions during the test period (7-day click, 1-day view).
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
cat > resources/geo_test_readout_agency.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Geo test readout (agency)

During the test period, test regions generated €317,922 in revenue vs €268,417 in control regions: +18.4%.
Incremental revenue from Meta = €49,505 on €9,152 of test-region Meta spend: iROAS 5.41x, above the 2.86x break-even.
Recommendation: Meta is clearly incremental; keep spend and scale nationally by 25%.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
